      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s wrong?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007420190073002000770072006F006E0067003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Those Dedenne?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006F0073006500200044006500640065006E006E0065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, the fact that you defeated our Dedenne led\nto quite a lot of bother...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Not that I’m blaming you personally,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004E006F007400200074006800610074002000492019006D00200062006C0061006D0069006E006700200079006F007500200070006500720073006F006E0061006C006C0079002C000A0010000201000000002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But there are some people in the company who\ndidn’t want to properly look into who defeated<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nour guards—or why that was even possible.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey only wanted to cause a commotion over the\nfact that our guards were defeated at all...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 236
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There was a great deal of debate over what we\nshould do to avoid such trouble in the future...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand the solution we landed on was Morpeko.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d like to ask you to battle our Morpeko guards\nand evaluate whether they will be up to the task.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please let me know as soon as you’re ready.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300650020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F007700200061007300200073006F006F006E00200061007300200079006F0075201900720065002000720065006100640079002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you willing to battle our Morpeko guards?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F0075002000770069006C006C0069006E006700200074006F00200062006100740074006C00650020006F007500720020004D006F007200700065006B006F0020006700750061007200640073003F00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll do it!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200064006F00200069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right. I will wait until you’re ready.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000720069006700680074002E00200049002000770069006C006C0020007700610069007400200075006E00740069006C00200079006F0075201900720065002000720065006100640079002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for your cooperation. Shall we move to\nthe nearby battle court?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
